DFT quadrature attribution
--------------------------
The Lebedev coefficient tables and Krack-Koster radial quadrature expression
in src/dft/grid/atomic.cpp are adapted from PySCF dft/LebedevGrid.py and
dft/radi.py, Copyright 2014-2018 The PySCF Developers, under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. They have been reorganized into a C++ orbit generator and grid
implementation. The applicable license is in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.

Sources:
https://pyscf.org/_modules/pyscf/dft/LebedevGrid.html
https://pyscf.org/_modules/pyscf/dft/radi.html

Lebedev-Laikov quadrature:
V. I. Lebedev and D. N. Laikov, A quadrature formula for the sphere of the
131st algebraic order of accuracy, Doklady Mathematics 59 (1999), 477-481.
